{{en-noun|head=[[rhetorical]] [[question]]}}

# A [[question]] posed only for dramatic or persuasive effect.
#:
# {{context|colloquial|lang=en}} A question to which the asker does not expect an answer.
#: ''Are you nuts?  Don't answer that - it's a '''rhetorical question'''.''

